id: pm-context-ylx4
title: Adopt the canonical docstring gate so the documented surface cannot regress silently
description: "pm-context had no docstring gate, so six exported declarations carried no documentation and nothing would have caught a seventh. Wired in the canonical analyzer published as pm-ops docstrings through a thin launcher and documented the remaining surface."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: ci,docstrings,gate
created_at: "2026-08-09T21:55:25.640Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-09T21:55:32.302Z"
deadline: "2026-08-10T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-09T21:55:32.286Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-09T21:55:32.286Z"
author: claude
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "npm run docstring exits zero, the gate is a required CI step and part of release:check, the analyzer is imported from pm-ops rather than vendored, and coverage stays at 100 percent with the launcher included"
resolution: fixed
expected_result: npm run docstring exits zero as a required CI step and coverage stays at 100 percent
actual_result: "The gate reports 4 files and 19 declarations documented, coverage is 100 across statements branches and functions including the launcher, and the step is required in ci.yml and release:check"
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
